  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Space girls participation and leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">he present project implemented by APJK targets  a young  citizen participation particular a girl for 15 months . The location is Kati  15 km form Bamako. it  aims to strengthen girls&apos; participation in governance in Kati and facilitate   community dialogue. This project consists to create  in the commune an effective  capacities to  mobilize and sensitize .Through the project  ensure to youngparticular  a girl to exercise citizen control  and participate  public affairs that concern them and reducing their marginalization. The  objective are to contribute to active citizen participation for  140 girls in kati
Specific objectives :-Strengthen the organizational and institutional capacities of the AJPK;- To enable girls to better understand their rights,duties and responsibilities as citizens and to have spaces for debate and opportunities to express their understanding of citizenship;. - Strengthened young girls actively contribute to the use of techniques on social networks and propose alternatives concerning communal politics and citizenconstruction;The main activities to be carried out during this phase are as follows:- Research on girls&apos; priorities for civic participation; - Information and community awareness-raising on the issues of political andsocial participation of girls;- Training of young girls on skills and competencies related to participation and active citizenship;- Organization of consultations between young girls, citizens and communal authorities;- Development of interactive gamesonactive citizenship and communal development aimed at encouraging young girls to understand the processes of decision-making, communal management and the rights and duties of young people. Organization of civic education meetings to develop and share publiccampaign materials in the municipality and surrounding area on democracy and active citizenship. - Political advocacy and lobbying- The establishment and animation of a mobile learning platform toimprove the quality of their political and social participation and address several major socio-cultural constraints that prevent them from fully playing their roles and responsibilities as active citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
